OL,3,AGlasgow City Council pauses plan to
OL,4,Afire and rehire 23,000 staff
OL,5,
OL,6,FGlasgow City Council has agreed to
OL,7,Fpause plans to fire and rehire more
OL,8,Fthan 23,000 members of staff, the BBC
OL,9,Fhas been told.
OL,11,FThe decision follows online talks
OL,12,Fbetween the council and three trade
OL,13,Funions, chaired by Deputy First
OL,14,FMinister Jenny Gilruth.
OL,16,FIt is understood that negotiations
OL,17,Fbetween the council and the GMB, Unison
OL,18,Fand Unite unions will resume early next
OL,19,Fweek to try to reach a new deal on pay.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
